+ABACUS H0Lite: modified ABACUS source, not an official ABACUS release
+Package revision: h0lite-v311-simpson-buffered-20260907
+Modification date: 2026-09-07
+Modifications by: HamGNN H0Lite contributors (2004huwa)
+Copyright (C) 2026 HamGNN H0Lite contributors for their additions.
+
+Based on ABACUS 3.11.0-beta8:
+https://github.com/deepmodeling/abacus-develop
+Upstream commit: d88b719ea287e13b0e133eb57b8e16baa5361fa6
+The original authors' copyright and license notices remain applicable.
+ABACUS is provided under LGPL version 3. The new H0Lite code is provided under
+LGPL version 3 or, at your option, any later version. This notice does not
+relicense third-party components or extend upstream grants.
+
+Changes: standalone H0/S0 frontend without SCF or diagonalization; optional
+local ionic potential merged into H0; preserved SCF input parsing; native
+batch scheduling and Slurm sharding; static build and license embedding.
+Numerical integration uses the ABACUS 3.11 finite-grid Simpson implementation.
+An explicit H0-only table mode restores historical distance-grid, cutoff and
+four-point interpolation conventions; scalar diagonal-projector coupling is
+retained for compatibility. Independent direct-transform rows use OpenMP.
